<div className="fi"><button className="fi-q">What is the minimum number of clients I need?</button><div className="fi-a">There's no minimum. You can start with a single client and scale from there. Our pricing is designed to be profitable even for one client — though margins improve significantly at 5+ clients.</div></div>
